{"route":"/docs/4.6/components/breadcrumb/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Breadcrumb","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/components/breadcrumb.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Indicate the current page’s location within a navigational hierarchy that automatically adds separators via CSS."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"66ef80ae05e93226da8f","height":201},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Library</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Library</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Data</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>","language":"html"},{"id":"changing-the-separator","type":"heading","en":"Changing the separator","level":2},{"id":"changing-the-separator--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Separators are automatically added in CSS through <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/::before\"><code>::before</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/content\"><code>content</code></a>. They can be changed by changing <code>$breadcrumb-divider</code>. The <a href=\"https://sass-lang.com/documentation/modules/string#quote\">quote</a> function is needed to generate the quotes around a string, so if you want <code>&gt;</code> as separator, you can use this:"},{"id":"changing-the-separator--code-1","type":"code","value":"$breadcrumb-divider: quote(\">\");","language":"scss"},{"id":"changing-the-separator--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"It’s also possible to use a <strong>base64 embedded SVG icon</strong>:"},{"id":"changing-the-separator--code-2","type":"code","value":"$breadcrumb-divider: url(data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0yLjUgMEwxIDEuNSAzLjUgNCAxIDYuNSAyLjUgOGw0LTQtNC00eiIgZmlsbD0iY3VycmVudENvbG9yIi8+PC9zdmc+);","language":"scss"},{"id":"changing-the-separator--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"The separator can be removed by setting <code>$breadcrumb-divider</code> to <code>none</code>:"},{"id":"changing-the-separator--code-3","type":"code","value":"$breadcrumb-divider: none;","language":"scss"},{"id":"accessibility","type":"heading","en":"Accessibility","level":2},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Since breadcrumbs provide a navigation, it’s a good idea to add a meaningful label such as <code>aria-label=&quot;breadcrumb&quot;</code> to describe the type of navigation provided in the <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> element, as well as applying an <code>aria-current=&quot;page&quot;</code> to the last item of the set to indicate that it represents the current page."},{"id":"accessibility--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"For more information, see the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/breadcrumb/\">ARIA Authoring Practices Guide breadcrumb pattern</a>."}],"demos":[{"key":"66ef80ae05e93226da8f","html":"\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Library</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"#\">Library</a></li>\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb-item active\" aria-current=\"page\">Data</li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Alerts","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Badge","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/badge/"},{"en":"Breadcrumb","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/breadcrumb/"},{"en":"Buttons","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/buttons/"},{"en":"Button group","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/button-group/"},{"en":"Card","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/card/"},{"en":"Carousel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/carousel/"},{"en":"Collapse","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/collapse/"},{"en":"Dropdowns","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/dropdowns/"},{"en":"Forms","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/forms/"},{"en":"Input group","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/input-group/"},{"en":"Jumbotron","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/jumbotron/"},{"en":"List group","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/list-group/"},{"en":"Media object","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/media-object/"},{"en":"Modal","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/modal/"},{"en":"Navs","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/d